ructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Don't take the scenic route!"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}], "template_override": 1}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le14ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le14ob03re2img06.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le14ob03re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Taxi!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Taxi driver</span>: Yes, Miss. Where are you going?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm going to Cambridge. Can you drop me off at the intersection of Holyoke and Mt Auburn St?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Taxi driver</span>: Sure. Let me help with your bags. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thank you \u2026 Do you have a flat rate for the fare?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le14ob03re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Taxi driver</span>: Yes, but the traffic is not heavy at the moment. It will be cheaper to use the meter.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ok \u2026 What's the fastest route?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Taxi driver</span>: We could take the Interstate and turn right on Anderson Memorial Bridge. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Is there a quicker way? Could you take Storrow Drive instead?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Taxi driver</span>: Of course. Storrow Drive is shorter than the Interstate, but the traffic is heavier.", "id": 2, "time": "14000", "image": "engenn5le14ob03re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Which one is cheaper?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Taxi driver</span>: It's about the same, really. There is a toll on the Interstate, and there is a tunnel fee to get to Storrow Drive.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Alright. Just take whatever is faster, then. I trust you. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Taxi driver</span>: Absolutely! I'm the best driver in town!", "id": 3, "time": "35500", "image": "engenn5le14ob03re2img01.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally Comes Home"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "On the Way Home"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 14}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe rooms, homes and objects in buildings in common social and work situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le14ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Making and Responding to Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "It's important to be polite when you ask for something or respond to requests."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can make a request by using: <span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>can you ... ?</li> <li>could you ... ?</li> <li>will you ... ?</li> <li>would you mind ... ?</li></ul></span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Making Requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can you drop me off at the intersection of Holyoke and Mt Auburn Street?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure. Let me help you with your bags.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could you take Storrow Drive instead?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Of course. Storrow Drive is faster than the Interstate.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Comparative and Superlative Adjectives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use a comparative to compare somebody or something to <span class=\"strong\">one</span> other person or thing. </br>You use a superlative to compare somebody or something to the whole <span class=\"strong\">group</span> that he, she or it belongs to."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Storrow Drive is shorter than the Interstate, but the Interstate is the fastest route."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>you use <span class=\"strong\">than</span> after comparatives</li> <li>you add the in front of <span class=\"strong\">the</span> superlative form to describe people, places and things</li></ul>  </p>Look at the chart for information on how to form the comparative and superlative:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comparative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superlative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"short\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shorter (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the shortest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"late\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"later (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the latest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"heavy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"heavier (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the latest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"expensive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more expensive (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the most expensive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"good</br> bad\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"better (than)</br> worse (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the best</br> the worst\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to drop off "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to bring a person to a certain destination"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can you drop me off at the intersection of First and Main St?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk to a taxi driver."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fee "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the price you pay for a service; surcharge"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is a $2 fee to exit the airport."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "toll"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the price you pay to use a particular road or structure"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is a toll on the Interstate."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Interstate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a system of highways in the USA"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We could take the Interstate and turn right at the bridge."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "flat rate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a fixed price for a taxi ride"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The taxi offers a $40 flat rate to Cambridge from the airport."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tunnel"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an underground passage through a hill or river"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We could take the Sumner Tunnel to get to Storrow Drive."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "meter"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a device that shows how much the taxi fare is"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's cheaper to use the meter right now. The traffic is very light."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob03aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "route"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a way to get to a destination from a starting point."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What's the fastest route to get to Holyoke Street?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob03aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, write a dialog (10-12 lines) between a cab driver and a passenger."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask the cab driver for different routes to the airport from your home."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Compare the different routes and decide on the best way to get to the airport."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your dialogue with your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change roles."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue with a cabbie."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use comparative and superlative adjectives to describe things and people."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make and respond to requests."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my dialogue with a partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}